The immediate emotional pull is probably towards cutting ties because she needs to prioritize her own survival. The guilt is there, but if staying means her own downfall, the healthier choice is to step back. She can't pour from an empty cup. Even though she feels responsible, she has to take care of herself first. The decision should be action 1: cut ties, because she can't keep drowning to keep others afloat.
